{"id":"d5799bfb276cc60ae851bae2a7d2c21ddcc4e26b","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251624","title":"微信是怎么屏蔽 codex 的","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"garydab","excerpt":"OpenAI - @garydab - 微信是怎么屏蔽 codex 的，理论上 codex 是通过图形界面操作微信的，模仿人类的吧. 现在只要我让 codex 操作微信，微信就自动退出，让我重新登录。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div><p>微信是怎么屏蔽 codex 的，理论上 codex 是通过图形界面操作微信的，模仿人类的吧. 现在只要我让 codex 操作微信，微信就自动退出，让我重新登录。</p></div><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/微信\"><li></li> 微信</a><a href=\"/tag/屏蔽\"><li></li> 屏蔽</a><a href=\"/tag/操作\"><li></li> 操作</a></P><p><span>16 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-10-25 23:53:45 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18218431\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/daa907248202cd5689f03714b382ddce?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"win8en\" data-uid=\"195910\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/win8en\">win8en</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 13:12:30 +08:00\">18h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>让 Codex 给你分析一下，中国的 app 都爱搞这些小把戏。手机挂代理的时候，其他应用都可以正常投屏电视，但是就抖音说让我关闭代理，不关就不让用。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18218442\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ebea/d1b0/254966_normal.png?m=1779740858\" alt=\"noahhhh\" data-uid=\"254966\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/noahhhh\">noahhhh</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 13:24:46 +08:00\">18h 1m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你是操作电脑吗，程序可以识别模拟点击的，投屏可能更难识别一点🤔</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18218471\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4fd1/00b1/54739_normal.png?m=1703821019\" alt=\"awfe\" data-uid=\"54739\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/awfe\">awfe</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 13:48:20 +08:00\">17h 37m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 2</span>\n                    \n                    <p>刚刚让 codex 实机测试了一下，他的结论是通过事件的来源进程能够发现是`Codex Computer <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://Use.app\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Use.app</a> 内的 SkyComputerUseService` 在进行操作。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18218843\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/82fcbc4c716cc289d59eed05b7f98336?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"scegg\" data-uid=\"128796\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/scegg\">scegg</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 19:51:05 +08:00\">11h 34m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>AI 控制微信：合法方案：RPA 。能用的方案，让 codex 开发一个能操作电脑的 app ，而不是直接用它自己的 Codex Computer Use 。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18218875\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/38c83d35c0c9b2a550ae019859385ab7?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"attker\" data-uid=\"86647\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/attker\">attker</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 20:27:58 +08:00\">10h 58m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我把微信的权限关了就能正常使用 computer use ，例如截图权限</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18218928\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d087/7338/378303_normal.png?m=1790214928\" alt=\"unco020511\" data-uid=\"378303\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/unco020511\">unco020511</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 21:03:25 +08:00\">10h 22m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>用 iPhone 镜像，然后让 codex 操作 iPhone 镜像来操作微信</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18218988\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c9d5/ae38/387595_normal.png?m=1791358051\" alt=\"kenneth104\" data-uid=\"387595\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kenneth104\">kenneth104</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 21:56:10 +08:00\">9h 29m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我用 zcode 他也说看不到微信，我让他把写好的 apk 发给我而已</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219016\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0b2f/c489/598051_normal.png?m=1786591349\" alt=\"CHTRCT\" data-uid=\"598051\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/CHTRCT\">CHTRCT</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 22:15:48 +08:00\">9h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你没发现你打开电脑微信的时候都要请求你获得管理员权限吗</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219034\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f72c/3766/494545_normal.png?m=1592034099\" alt=\"byte10\" data-uid=\"494545\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/byte10\">byte10</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 22:28:43 +08:00\">8h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>使用 ESP32 hid 这个模拟鼠标键盘，再用 AI 识别图来操作吧。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219115\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/88bc/1669/319815_normal.png?m=1792941544\" alt=\"Errat1c\" data-uid=\"319815\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Errat1c\">Errat1c</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 23:23:32 +08:00\">8h 2m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>很多 APP 都有做这类风控，所以手机上的 AI 助理暂时还发挥不了太大作用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219133\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d21f/e825/480177_normal.png?m=1790626045\" alt=\"s1n1an\" data-uid=\"480177\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/s1n1an\">s1n1an</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 23:35:35 +08:00\">7h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不一定是 Codex ，我台式机登微信 + 挂着 sunshine 远程软件，笔记本用 moonlight 连接台式机远控，微信都直接退出</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219149\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/131d93dcab57a38bc8894f720efde3e4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"cctv180\" data-uid=\"533234\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cctv180\">cctv180</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 23:53:45 +08:00\">7h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>检测到不很正常么，国内软件爱获取管理员身份 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ug1iMq4.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ug1iMq4.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a>，像游戏外挂他们得利用 dma 把数据搬出去再用另外一台机来开挂。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"微信是怎么屏蔽 codex 的，理论上 codex 是通过图形界面操作微信的，模仿人类的吧. 现在只要我让 codex 操作微信，微信就自动退出，让我重新登录。 微信 屏蔽 操作16 replies • 2026-10-25 23:53:45 +08:00 1 win8en 18h 13m ago 让 Codex 给你分析一下，中国的 app 都爱搞这些小把戏。手机挂代理的时候，其他应用都可以正常投屏电视，但是就抖音说让我关闭代理，不关就不让用。 2 noahhhh 18h 1m ago via Android 你是操作电脑吗，程序可以识别模拟点击的，投屏可能更难识别一点🤔 6 awfe 17h 37m ago 2 刚刚让 codex 实机测试了一下，他的结论是通过事件的来源进程能够发现是